here is a lot of buzz about software design patterns, and one of the most frequently asked questions is “How can I use <em>some pattern</em> with <em>some technology</em> “. In the case of Laravel and the Repository pattern, I see often questions like <em><strong>“ How I can use repository pattern in Laravel 4”</strong></em> or nowadays <em>** “..in Laravel 5”**</em>. Important thing you must remember is that <strong>design patterns do not depend on specific technology, framework or programming language</strong>.</p>
